    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's perfect. it really drives home how he was basically puppeteering everything. do u think historians who argue for the \"class struggle\" or socioeconomic causes are just missing the point entirely? like, is their view just a simplified way of ignoring the actual intellectual power at play?",
      "source": "evaluator"
